## Performance Benchmarks (Real-World Observations)

### Typical Throughput Comparison

| Scenario | Newtonsoft.Json (.NET 4.8) | System.Text.Json (.NET 7) | Speedup |
|---|---|---|---|
| Simple POJO (50 props) | ~15 MB/s | ~60–90 MB/s | **4–6x** |
