For large, complex object graphs, **System.Text.Json in .NET 7 is meaningfully faster** than Newtonsoft.Json — typically **2–5x serialization** and **3–8x deserialization** — but the gap has narrowed significantly compared to earlier .NET Core versions. The gains are *real*, not negligible, though context matters enormously.

